---
// V1 · Editorial — magazine-editorial style
// Deep forest #2D4A2B + warm sand #F5EFE2 + Fraunces oversized serif
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>V1 · Editorial · Rain Fan</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300..900;1,9..144,300..900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #F5EFE2;
        --paper: #FCFAF5;
        --ink: #1A1A1A;
        --muted: #5C5650;
        --accent: #2D4A2B;
        --accent-soft: #5C7A4D;
        --border: #D8CFBE;
      }

      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      /* Preview nav (sticky chip) */
      .preview-nav {
        position: fixed; top: 1rem; right: 1rem; z-index: 50;
        background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 9999px; padding: 0.375rem 0.5rem;
        display: flex; gap: 0.25rem; align-items: center;
        font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: 'Inter', monospace;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
      }
      .preview-nav a, .preview-nav span {
        color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem; border-radius: 9999px;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }
      .preview-nav a:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--paper); }
      .preview-nav .current { color: var(--paper); background: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }

      .wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }

      /* Top bar / masthead */
      .masthead {
        padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;
        font-family: 'Inter', monospace;
        font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .masthead-title {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0;
        text-transform: none; color: var(--ink);
        font-style: italic;
      }

      /* Hero */
      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 3rem;
        padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
        align-items: center;
      }
      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .hero { grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; }
      }
      .hero-eyebrow {
        font-family: 'Inter', monospace;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.3em;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
      }
      .hero-eyebrow::before {
        content: ""; height: 1px; width: 2rem; background: var(--accent);
      }
      .hero-title {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
        font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 8.5vw, 6.5rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 0.95;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      .hero-title em {
        font-style: italic;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144;
      }
      .hero-role {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 1.375rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 36;
      }
      .hero-tagline {
        font-size: 1.0625rem;
        color: var(--ink);
        max-width: 36rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }
      .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .btn {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }
      .btn-primary {
        background: var(--accent); color: var(--paper);
        padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 9999px;
      }
      .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--ink); transform: translateX(2px); }
      .btn-ghost {
        color: var(--ink);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
        padding: 0 0 0.125rem 0;
      }
      .btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }

      /* Hero figure (placeholder for photo) */
      .hero-figure {
        aspect-ratio: 3/4;
        background:
          linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, var(--accent-soft) 100%);
        border-radius: 4px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .hero-figure::before {
        content: "01"; position: absolute;
        top: 1.5rem; left: 1.5rem;
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }
      .hero-figure::after {
        content: "Rain"; position: absolute;
        bottom: 1.25rem; right: 1.5rem;
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic;
        font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 300;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      /* Section */
      .section {
        padding: 5rem 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .section-eyebrow {
        font-family: 'Inter', monospace;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.3em;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .section-title {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.1;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        max-width: 36rem;
        font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
      }

      .about-grid {
        display: grid; gap: 2rem;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 4rem; }
      }
      .about-aside {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--accent);
        font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 36;
      }
      .about-text p {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-size: 1.0625rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        max-width: 38rem;
      }
      .pullquote {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1.625rem;
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: var(--accent);
        border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
        padding-left: 1.75rem;
        max-width: 38rem;
        margin: 2.5rem 0;
        font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
      }

      /* Footer */
      footer {
        padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-family: 'Inter', monospace;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="preview-nav">
      <span class="current">V1 Editorial</span>
      <a href="/en/preview/v2/">V2 Bold</a>
      <a href="/en/preview/v3/">V3 Soft</a>
      <a href="/en/preview/" title="back to index">↩</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="masthead">
        <span>FOLIO · MMXXVI</span>
        <span class="masthead-title">Rain Fan · Rain</span>
        <span>VOL. I</span>
      </header>

      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <p class="hero-eyebrow">A finance person becoming a builder</p>
          <h1 class="hero-title">
            Finance,<br />then <em>code</em>.<br />Then both.
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-role">Rain Fan · Rain — Finance analyst turning AI builder.</p>
          <p class="hero-tagline">
            M.A. in Public Finance from Southwestern University of Finance and Economics, CPA, 3 years at KPMG Shenzhen audit.
            Then I started using AI to rebuild finance workflows — this year I'm writing code and shipping products myself.
            I want to help teams still stuck in repetitive work hand the flow over to agents.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">See projects <span>→</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#">Get in touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-figure"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Essay I · About</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">The path isn't neat,<br />but the thread is consistent.</h2>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <aside class="about-aside">
            "AI won't make product decisions for me, but it has shrunk the distance from 'the solution I can imagine' to 'working implementation' by 10×."
          </aside>
          <div class="about-text">
            <p>
              My foundation is finance: B.A. in Investment from Tianjin Normal University, M.A. in Public Finance from SWUFE, CPA Accounting passed, 3 years at KPMG Shenzhen audit — dual-standard consolidations for 30+ subsidiaries, leading financial due diligence for IPO-bound clients. That gave me two things: the ability to read a company, and a deep aversion to repetitive work.
            </p>
            <p>
              In 2024 I left KPMG and joined a short-form video startup as a finance BP. There I first brought AI and VBA into multi-platform revenue reconciliation, lifting efficiency by 30%. From that moment I saw one thing clearly —
            </p>
            <blockquote class="pullquote">
              AI doesn't free programmers; it frees people who understand the business but are trapped by the process.
            </blockquote>
            <p>
              In 2026 I spent 5 weeks using Cursor + Claude Code to deliver a complete, paid e-commerce system for my sister's fried chicken shop in Minsk. That was my first closed loop from "finance person" to "independent product shipper."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <footer class="wrap">
      <p>V1 · Editorial — Forest #2D4A2B · Sand #F5EFE2 · Fraunces / Inter</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
